#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "View how much cost has been incurred by an instance"
msgstr "Tingnan kung magkano na ang nagastos ng isang instance"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "View the cost"
msgstr "Tingnan ang gastos"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View the cost {#view-the-cost}"
msgstr "Tingnan ang gastos {#view-the-cost}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At any time, you can see how much cost has been incurred by workloads "
"associated with an instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kahit kailan, makikita mo kung magkano na ang nagastos ng mga workload na "
"nauugnay sa isang instance.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View instance cost {#view-instance-cost}"
msgstr "Tingnan ang gastos ng instance {#view-instance-cost}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To determine how much an instance has been used, from the [Instances "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), click the instance to open "
"its details page. You can click the link associated with **Billing "
"overview** for full cost and billing details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para malaman kung gaano na nagamit ang isang instance, mula sa [pahina ng "
"Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), i-click ang instance "
"para buksan ang detalye nito. Maaari mong i-click ang link na nauugnay sa "
"**Billing overview** para sa buong detalye ng gastos at billing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Instance usage** reports a different value, depending on the type of plan "
"the instance is associated with:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagpapakita ang **Instance usage** ng magkaibang halaga, depende sa uri ng "
"plano na nauugnay sa instance:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For Premium and Open plans, this is the real-time usage for the last 28 days"
" (rolling), up to the current time on the current day.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa Premium at Open na plano, ito ang real-time na paggamit sa nakalipas"
" na 28 araw (rolling), hanggang sa kasalukuyang oras sa kasalukuyang araw.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For Pay-As-You-Go plans, this is all usage from the time the instance was "
"created.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa Pay-As-You-Go na plano, ito ang lahat ng paggamit mula nang likhain "
"ang instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For Flex plans, this is the usage from the beginning of the contract. \n"
msgstr "Para sa Flex na plano, ito ang paggamit mula sa simula ng kontrata.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View workload usage {#view-workload-usage}"
msgstr "Tingnan ang paggamit ng workload {#view-workload-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To determine how much usage a specific workload incurred, open the "
"[Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) and view the "
"\"Usage\" column for the workload. \n"
msgstr ""
"Para malaman kung gaano karaming paggamit ang nagastos ng isang partikular "
"na workload, buksan ang [pahina ng "
"Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) at tingnan ang kolum na "
"\"Usage\" para sa workload.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- To learn how to limit costs, see [Manage costs](/guides/manage-cost).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Para matutunan kung paano limitahan ang mga gastos, tingnan ang [Pamahalaan ang mga gastos](/guides/manage-cost).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
